3.1 Server update karo

Ye command paste karo:

sudo apt update && sudo apt upgrade -y

Thoda time lagega. Complete hone do.

3.2 Docker install karo

Ab ye command:

curl -fsSL https://get.docker.com | sudo sh

Install complete hone do.

3.3 Docker check karo
sudo docker --version

Aapko kuch aisa output milna chahiye:

Docker version 28.x.x

Version number alag ho sakta hai.


3.4 Docker Compose check karo
sudo docker compose version

Aisa output aana chahiye:

Docker Compose version v2.x.x

3.5 Docker ko sudo ke bina chalane ke liye

Ye command run karo:

sudo usermod -aG docker $USER

Phir:

newgrp docker

Ab check:

docker --version

Aur:

docker compose version

Step 4


4.1 Evolution API ka folder banao

AWS terminal me ye command chalao:

mkdir -p ~/evolution-api
cd ~/evolution-api


Check:

pwd

Output kuch aisa hona chahiye:

/home/ubuntu/evolution-api
4.2 Docker Compose file banao

Ye command chalao:

nano docker-compose.yml
Paste This 
#  POSTGRES_PASSWORD: CHANGE_THIS_DB_PASSWORD change this line
# SERVER_URL: http://YOUR_EC2_PUBLIC_IP:8080
# AUTHENTICATION_API_KEY: CHANGE_THIS_API_KEY
# DATABASE_CONNECTION_URI: postgresql://evolution:CHANGE_THIS_DB_PASSWORD@postgres:5432/evolution
services:

  postgres:
    image: postgres:15
    container_name: evolution_postgres
    restart: always
    environment:
      POSTGRES_DB: evolution
      POSTGRES_USER: evolution
      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: CHANGE_THIS_DB_PASSWORD
    volumes:
      - postgres_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data

  redis:
    image: redis:7
    container_name: evolution_redis
    restart: always
    volumes:
      - redis_data:/data

  evolution-api:
    image: evoapicloud/evolution-api:latest
    container_name: evolution_api
    restart: always
    depends_on:
      - postgres
      - redis
    ports:
      - "8080:8080"
    environment:
      SERVER_TYPE: http
      SERVER_PORT: 8080
      SERVER_URL: http://YOUR_EC2_PUBLIC_IP:8080

      AUTHENTICATION_API_KEY: CHANGE_THIS_API_KEY

      DATABASE_PROVIDER: postgresql
      DATABASE_CONNECTION_URI: postgresql://evolution:CHANGE_THIS_DB_PASSWORD@postgres:5432/evolution
      DATABASE_CONNECTION_CLIENT_NAME: evolution

      DATABASE_SAVE_DATA_INSTANCE: "true"
      DATABASE_SAVE_DATA_NEW_MESSAGE: "true"
      DATABASE_SAVE_MESSAGE_UPDATE: "true"
      DATABASE_SAVE_DATA_CONTACTS: "true"
      DATABASE_SAVE_DATA_CHATS: "true"
      DATABASE_SAVE_DATA_LABELS: "true"
      DATABASE_SAVE_DATA_HISTORIC: "true"

      CACHE_REDIS_ENABLED: "true"
      CACHE_REDIS_URI: redis://redis:6379
      CACHE_REDIS_PREFIX_KEY: evolution
      CACHE_REDIS_SAVE_INSTANCES: "false"

      CACHE_LOCAL_ENABLED: "false"

      CONFIG_SESSION_PHONE_CLIENT: Evolution API
      CONFIG_SESSION_PHONE_NAME: Chrome

      QRCODE_LIMIT: "30"

volumes:
  postgres_data:
  redis_data:

6.4 File save karo

Nano me:

Ctrl + O

phir:

Enter

phir:

Ctrl + X

6.5 Configuration check karo


docker compose config

6.6 Ab containers start karo
docker compose up -d

Thoda time lagega kyunki PostgreSQL, Redis aur Evolution API images download hongi.

Phir:

docker ps
Hume ideally 3 containers chahiye:

evolution_api
evolution_postgres
evolution_redis



